in der Player-Leiste.",[23,1133,1135],{"id":1134},"eingang-wählen","Eingang wählen",[14,1137,119,1138,1141],{},[18,1139,1140],{},"Einstellungen → Audio",":",[66,1143,1144,1150,1156],{},[31,1145,1146,1149],{},[18,1147,1148],{},"Eingabegeräte"," — Mikrofon",[31,1151,1152,1155],{},[18,1153,1154],{},"Ausgabegeräte (PC-Audio)"," — Loopback dessen, was der PC spielt",[31,1157,1158,1161],{},[18,1159,1160],{},"Eingangslautstärke"," — Aufnahme-Gain von 0 % bis 200 %",[14,1163,1164],{},"Der Aufnahme-Button nutzt das hier gewählte Gerät.",[23,1166,1168],{"id":1167},"take-bearbeiten","Take bearbeiten",[66,1170,1171,1174,1177,1185,1188,1191],{},[31,1172,1173],{},"Aufnehmen und stoppen",[31,1175,1176],{},"Pegelmesser beobachten",[31,1178,1179,319,1182],{},[18,1180,1181],{},"Normalisieren",[18,1183,1184],{},"Rauschunterdrückung",[31,1186,1187],{},"Ganzen Clip trimmen, auf Auswahl trimmen oder Auswahl löschen",[31,1189,1190],{},"Rückgängig \u002F Wiederholen",[31,1192,1193],{},"Rein- und rauszoomen",[23,1195,1197],{"id":1196},"stagen-und-importieren","Stagen und importieren",[28,1199,1200,1203,1206],{},[31,1201,1202],{},"Auswahl oder ganzen Track zur Staging-Liste hinzufügen.",[31,1204,1205],{},"Die Liste startet leer: aufnehmen, bearbeiten, dann Clip hinzufügen.",[31,1207,1208,319,1210,1212],{},[18,1209,570],{},[18,1211,573],{}," in den aktuellen oder einen gewählten Tab.",[23,1214,1216],{"id":1215},"stem-trennung-optional","Stem-Trennung (optional)",[14,1218,1219,1220,1223,1224,319,1227,1230],{},"Offizielle Windows-, macOS- und Linux-Release-Builds enthalten das ",[18,1221,1222],{},"Stems","-Feature. Der Aufnahme-Editor kann ",[18,1225,1226],{},"Gesang",[18,1228,1229],{},"Musik"," mit BS-RoFormer behalten.",[14,1232,1233,1234,1237,1238,1241],{},"Das Modell ist etwa 158 MB und ",[18,1235,1236],{},"nicht"," im Installer. Download unter ",[18,1239,1240],{},"Einstellungen → Stem-Trennung"," oder über den Erststart-Hinweis. Der Windows-Installer kann den Download beim ersten Start anbieten.",[14,1243,1244,1245,41,1248,1251],{},"Eigene Source-Builds brauchen extra Flags (",[38,1246,1247],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[38,1249,1250],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1253},[1254,1255,1256,1257],{"id":1134,"depth":140,"text":1135},{"id":1167,"depth":140,"text":1168},{"id":1196,"depth":140,"text":1197},{"id":1215,"depth":140,"text":1216},"Mikrofon oder PC-Audio aufnehmen, den Clip bearbeiten und aufs Board legen.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1120,"description":1258},"recording-editor","mBUN6yUiwk-kNjhsf48NlWEXXhjw6cOuSAkybSa9wi0",{"id":1266,"title":1267,"body":1268,"description":1481,"extension":147,"meta":1482,"navigation":149,"order":1483,"path":1484,"seo":1485,"stem":1486,"__hash__":1487},"content_de\u002Fremote-control.md","Fernsteuerung",{"type":7,"value":1269,"toc":1474},[1270,1273,1276,1280,1310,1313,1316,1351,1355,1375,1378,1382,1414,1418,1424],[10,1271,1267],{"id":1272},"fernsteuerung",[14,1274,1275],{},"SoundNinja kann im lokalen Netz lauschen, damit Bitfocus Companion (oder jeder HTTP\u002FWebSocket-Client) Sounds spielt und stoppt.",[23,1277,1279],{"id":1278},"remote-server-einschalten","Remote-Server einschalten",[28,1281,1282,1288,1294,1300],{},[31,1283,1284,1287],{},[18,1285,1286],{},"Einstellungen → Remote"," öffnen.",[31,1289,1290,1291,21],{},"Remote-Server aktivieren. Standardport ist ",[18,1292,1293],{},"7331",[31,1295,1296,1297,21],{},"Optional: Token setzen. Clients senden ihn als Bearer-Token oder ",[38,1298,1299],{},"?token=",[31,1301,1302,1305,1306,1309],{},[38,1303,1304],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT"," kopieren oder die System-IP unter ",[18,1307,1308],{},"Einstellungen → Über"," holen.",[14,1311,1312],{},"Windows kann beim ersten Start eine Firewall-Abfrage zeigen. Zugriff im privaten Netz erlauben.",[23,1314,227],{"id":1315},"bitfocus-companion",[28,1317,1318,1325,1333,1344],{},[31,1319,1320,1324],{},[224,1321,227],{"href":1322,"rel":1323},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[246]," installieren.",[31,1326,1327,1332],{},[224,1328,1331],{"href":1329,"rel":1330},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002Fcompanion-module-soundninja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest",[246],"SoundNinja-Companion.tgz"," herunterladen. Es gibt noch kein Companion-Store-Paket.",[31,1334,1335,1336,1339,1340,1343],{},"In Companion: ",[18,1337,1338],{},"Modules → Load module package"," und die ",[38,1341,1342],{},".tgz"," wählen.",[31,1345,1346,1347,1350],{},"Eine ",[18,1348,1349],{},"Sound Ninja","-Verbindung anlegen. PC-IP, Port und Token eintragen.",[23,1352,1354],{"id":1353},"aktionen","Aktionen",[66,1356,1357,1363,1369],{},[31,1358,1359,1362],{},[18,1360,1361],{},"Trigger Sound"," — aus dem Live-Dropdown wählen oder 8-stellige Sound-ID tippen (Companion-Variablen gehen)",[31,1364,1365,1368],{},[18,1366,1367],{},"Stop Sound"," — einen spielenden Sound per ID stoppen",[31,1370,1371,1374],{},[18,1372,1373],{},"Stop All"," — alle spielenden Sounds stoppen",[14,1376,1377],{},"Sound-ID in SoundNinja über das Button-Kontextmenü oder den Mehrfachauswahl-Chip kopieren.",[23,1379,1381],{"id":1380},"feedbacks-und-variablen","Feedbacks und Variablen",[66,1383,1384,1390,1402,1408],{},[31,1385,1386,1389],{},[18,1387,1388],{},"Sound Playing"," — wahr, solange diese Sound-ID aktiv ist (für Button-Farbe)",[31,1391,1392,1395,1396,41,1399],{},[38,1393,1394],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[38,1397,1398],{},"true",[38,1400,1401],{},"false",[31,1403,1404,1407],{},[38,1405,1406],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — wie viele Sounds spielen",[31,1409,1410,1413],{},[38,1411,1412],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — zuletzt ausgelöste Sound-ID",[23,1415,1417],{"id":1416},"http-api-fortgeschritten","HTTP-API (fortgeschritten)",[14,1419,1420,1421],{},"Basispfad: ",[38,1422,1423],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[66,1425,1426,1432,1438,1444,1453,1459,1468],{},[31,1427,1428,1431],{},[38,1429,1430],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — App-Name, Version, Protokoll, ob ein Token nötig ist",[31,1433,1434,1437],{},[38,1435,1436],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — Soundliste (id, name, tabs, active)",[31,1439,1440,1443],{},[38,1441,1442],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — Sounds plus gerade spielende IDs",[31,1445,1446,588,1449,1452],{},[38,1447,1448],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger",[38,1450,1451],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — Sound abspielen",[31,1454,1455,1458],{},[38,1456,1457],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — abspielen (einfach im Browser testen)",[31,1460,1461,1464,1465,1467],{},[38,1462,1463],{},"POST \u002Fstop"," mit optionalem ",[38,1466,1451],{}," — einen Sound oder alle stoppen",[31,1469,1470,1473],{},[38,1471,1472],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — Live-Status; Trigger\u002FStop eingehend senden",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1475},[1476,1477,1478,1479,1480],{"id":1278,"depth":140,"text":1279},{"id":1315,"depth":140,"text":227},{"id":1353,"depth":140,"text":1354},{"id":1380,"depth":140,"text":1381},{"id":1416,"depth":140,"text":1417},"SoundNinja über das lokale Netz mit Bitfocus Companion auslösen.",{},7,"\u002Fremote-control",{"title":1267,"description":1481},"remote-control","pzsqq4CZS4ZlSf2WDcYK0UyO02dUISTU454C3gbbJFw",{"id":1489,"title":1490,"body":1491,"description":1579,"extension":147,"meta":1580,"navigation":149,"order":1581,"path":1582,"seo":1583,"stem":1495,"__hash__":1584},"content_de\u002Fsupport.md","Support",{"type":7,"value":1492,"toc":1572},[1493,1496,1499,1503,1506,1513,1521,1525,1532,1534,1546,1550,1561,1565],[10,1494,1490],{"id":1495},"support",[14,1497,1498],{},"SoundNinja ist ein Community-Projekt in früher Beta. Der schnellste Weg zur Hilfe ist GitHub.",[23,1500,1502],{"id":1501},"fehler-melden-oder-frage-stellen","Fehler melden oder Frage stellen",[14,1504,1505],{},"Issue auf GitHub öffnen:",[14,1507,1508],{},[224,1509,1512],{"href":1510,"rel":1511},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[246],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[14,1514,1515,1516,319,1518,1520],{},"OS, SoundNinja-Version (",[18,1517,405],{},[18,1519,1308],{},") und Schritte zum Nachstellen angeben.",[23,1522,1524],{"id":1523},"e-mail","E-Mail",[14,1526,1527,1528],{},"Maintainer: ",[224,1529,1531],{"href":1530},"mailto:contact@marcus-universe.de","contact@marcus-universe.de",[23,1533,399],{"id":398},[14,1535,402,1536,1538,1539,1541,1542,21],{},[18,1537,405],{},". Neue Builds stehen auch auf der ",[224,1540,300],{"href":299}," und bei ",[224,1543,306],{"href":1544,"rel":1545},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases",[246],[23,1547,1549],{"id":1548},"mitmachen","Mitmachen",[14,1551,1552,1553,1557,1558,21],{},"Pull Requests sind willkommen. App-Repo: ",[224,1554,1556],{"href":416,"rel":1555},[246],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja",". Lizenz: ",[224,1559,247],{"href":244,"rel":1560},[246],[23,1562,1564],{"id":1563},"rechtliches","Rechtliches",[14,1566,1567,1568,21],{},"Impressum und Kontaktdaten: ",[224,1569,1571],{"href":1570},"\u002Fimpressum","Impressum",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1573},[1574,1575,1576,1577,1578],{"id":1501,"depth":140,"text":1502},{"id":1523,"depth":140,"text":1524},{"id":398,"depth":140,"text":399},{"id":1548,"depth":140,"text":1549},{"id":1563,"depth":140,"text":1564},"Hilfe holen und Fehler melden.",{},8,"\u002Fsupport",{"title":1490,"description":1579},"qmZ7_9BNf5fpANXNPb6fUhg4rtoDFCqMYJ7xVG2xHIM",1789586416816]